<p>The desktop is behind your windows. In the Mac and Windows styles it shows your disks and what's in your Desktop folder; the NeXT style keeps it clear.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Right-click the desktop for <b>New Folder</b>, <b>Paste Item</b>, <b>Clean Up</b>, <b>Sort By</b> and <b>Change Background…</b>.</li>
  <li><b>Change Background…</b> opens Workspace's Preferences at <b>Background</b>: choose a background, its speed, and whether it shows on every display.</li>
  <li>When you click the desktop, Workspace's menus are the ones in use.</li>
</ul>
